You could use guilt-tripping to make your ex-boyfriend come back to you by repeatedly bringing up how much he will miss out on if he doesn't leave his current relationship for you, highlighting any obligations or responsibilities that make him feel guilty (e.g. children from a previous relationship), or exploiting his feelings of insecurity when it comes to losing you.
